          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "કાચબો (kācbo) is a tadbhava, a word inherited from Sanskrit and reshaped by sound change. It comes from kacchapa, \"turtle, tortoise\" (CDIAL 2619)."
            }
