              "text": "મચ્છર (macchar) is a tadbhava of the lexical Sanskrit matsara, \"mosquito, fly\" (CDIAL 9757). CDIAL lists Gujarati machrũ, \"gnat\", there, and finds no support for the idea that the Sanskrit word was made up from Prakrit."
